# Corpora and raw recordings: multi-GB, regenerated by `make load` /
# `scripts/prepare_data.py`. Nothing under data/ is tracked, so ignore the
# tree wholesale — data/raw_3cond/ and data/raw_3cond_organized/ were both
# missed by the old per-subdir rules, and each new corpus added another gap.
data/
runs
results
